OL,3,AMan, 36, arrested six years on from
OL,4,Adouble murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested on suspicion of
OL,7,Fmurder in connection with the fatal
OL,8,Fshooting of two men more than six years
OL,9,Fago.
OL,11,FJunior Ajose, 36, and Cheriff Tall, 21,
OL,12,Fwere shot dead at a lockdown party in
OL,13,Fthe Moss Side area of Manchester in the
OL,14,Fearly hours of 21 June 2020.
OL,16,FA Greater Manchester Police (GMP)
OL,17,Fspokesperson said a 36-year-old man was
OL,18,Fdetained in Turkey and transported back
OL,19,Fto England on Saturday, where he was
OL,20,Fmet at Stansted Airport by GMP
OL,21,Fofficers. He remains in custody.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
