OL,3,AMan, 36, arrested six years on from
OL,4,Adouble murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Neil Higginson from the
OL,7,Fforce's major incident team said: "This
OL,8,Farrest demonstrates our unwavering
OL,9,Fcommitment to securing justice for
OL,10,FJunior and Cheriff and their loved
OL,11,Fones."
